<h1 data-copy-en="Nerida" data-copy-zh="Nerida">Nerida</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Nerida’s three wellness locations, restorative baths, personal milestones and Aether Stone bond." data-copy-zh="Nerida在三个时代的水疗地点、恢复沐浴、个人里程碑与以太石羁绊。">Nerida’s three wellness locations, restorative baths, personal milestones and Aether Stone bond.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Nerida</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Aether_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Family_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie_.E2.80.94_Potion_Brewing_Unlock_and_Album"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie_—_Potion_Brewing_Unlock_and_Album"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Shared_Medieval_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimate_with_Nerida_.E2.80.94_Separate_Springs_Animation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimate_with_Nerida_—_Separate_Springs_Animation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stargazing_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One_Breath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quiet_Waters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Ordinary_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Six_Personal_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Take_Bath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Listen_to_Wisdom"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Nerida — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/nerida.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Nerida — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/nerida.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Nerida — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Nerida offers healing baths and wisdom across three eras. Her story milestones alternate between the Present spa, Medieval springs and Future wellness center; the location of each step matters.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Locations_and_Shared_Daily_Services"></span><h2>Where to find Nerida</h2><p>Find her at Present Downtown → Spa; Medieval Kings Demesne → Hot Springs; or Future Prime Sector → Virtual Wellness Immersion Center. The primary Chinese map labels are 水疗馆, 温泉 and 虚拟水疗馆. Her ordinary portraits are available all day.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Royal Hot Springs</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">all day</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tranquil Spa</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">all day</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Virtual Wellness Immersion Center</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">all day</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Route_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Unasked_Question"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Begin with the Spa introduction, then Still Water at Known (25), 09:00–18:00 in the Present. Quiet Waters follows at Acquaintance (50), 19:00–23:00. Move to the Medieval springs for The Same Water at Friend (100), then The Third Answer at Close Friend (200).</p><p>Complete The Unasked Question after the third-answer scene and Quiet Waters. At Crush (400), visit the Future wellness center for A Room for Rivers; return to the Present spa 19:00–23:00 for No Single Shore. One Breath then becomes available at the Present spa, also 19:00–23:00. These are personal milestones, not requirements for an ordinary restorative bath.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Still Water</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Tranquil Spa; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Nerida Known (25); after The Spa</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Nerida +20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Same Water</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Royal Hot Springs; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Nerida Friend (100); after Still Water / Quiet Waters</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Third Answer</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Royal Hot Springs; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Nerida Close Friend (200); after The Same Water</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Room for Rivers</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Virtual Wellness Immersion Center; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Nerida Crush (400); after The Third Answer / The Unasked Question</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Single Shore</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Tranquil Spa; 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Nerida Crush (400); after A Room for Rivers</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Spa</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Tranquil Spa; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Nerida +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Herbalist's Apprentice</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">General Goods Store; 10:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Willow Acknowledged (10); Nerida Acknowledged (10); Hailey Acknowledged (10); not vacationing: Willow</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Gentle Teacher</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Crafts and Jewelry Stall; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Rose &amp; Arthur Acknowledged (10); Nerida Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Unasked Question</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Royal Hot Springs; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after The Third Answer / Quiet Waters</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Quiet Waters</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tranquil Spa; 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Still Water</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">One Breath</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tranquil Spa; 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after No Single Shore / The Unasked Question</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stargazing Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tranquil Spa; 17:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $50; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Private_Bath_with_Nerida_.E2.80.94_Expanded_Branching_Visit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Private_Bath_with_Nerida_—_Expanded_Branching_Visit"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Listen to Wisdom takes 20 minutes for 1 base relationship point, eight safe uses daily. Take Bath costs 45 minutes and $100: Health +50, Energy +50, Calm +50, Satiation +20 and 3 base relationship points, up to ten successful baths daily. Both allowances are shared across all three eras.</p><p>Her Stargazing Date is a once-only Present-spa invitation at Friend (100), 17:00–19:00, costing 120 minutes, $50 and 40 Energy with the corresponding content access. Private Bath is a separate Present-spa visit at Romantic (800), 19:00–22:00, 60 minutes and 20 Energy. The springs animation instead requires 2,000 relationship points and starts 20:00–24:00 in the Medieval era.</p><p>With an owned Aether Stone and In Love (3000), Intimate Bonding costs 60 minutes and adds one stone level. All three eras share that once-daily use. Stone ownership, activation and bonding are separate; see Soul Stones for its effects.</p><p>Optional pregnancy care is checked at the Medieval springs. Follow the Pregnancy guide and current Objectives for readiness and visits.</p><p>Listed relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers can change the final gain. Daily allowances for the same action follow the character across locations; starting it elsewhere does not create a fresh allowance.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Strength 60 / Intelligence 60 / Charm 60 / Stamina 60 / Ability 60 / Creativity 60 / Perception 60 / Mystic 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Inner Peace</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Intimacy While Pregnant</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tranquil Spa; 19:00–23:00 (location action)</td><td data-label="Requirements">during the supported pregnancy stages</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Listen to Wisdom</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Royal Hot Springs; all day<br/>Tranquil Spa; all day<br/>Virtual Wellness Immersion Center; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 8 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Take Bath</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Royal Hot Springs; all day<br/>Tranquil Spa; all day<br/>Virtual Wellness Immersion Center; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; $100</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +3; 10 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate with Nerida</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Royal Hot Springs; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 2000; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +50; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Bath with Nerida</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tranquil Spa; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +25; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Bonding</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Royal Hot Springs; all day<br/>Tranquil Spa; all day<br/>Virtual Wellness Immersion Center; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); own Aether Stone</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Aether Stone level +1; once/day shared across locations</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quiet Waters</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">64</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unasked Question</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">76</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">One Breath</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">97</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>Traveling to another era does not reset wisdom, bath or bonding allowances. A missed personal scene often means the right stage but the wrong era. The Present private bath, Medieval animation and pregnancy activity are separate actions with different conditions.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a> · <a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy System</a> · <a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie’s Love Training</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Aether_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Family_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie_.E2.80.94_Potion_Brewing_Unlock_and_Album"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie_—_Potion_Brewing_Unlock_and_Album"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Shared_Medieval_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intimate_with_Nerida_.E2.80.94_Separate_Springs_Animation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intimate_with_Nerida_—_Separate_Springs_Animation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stargazing_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One_Breath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quiet_Waters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Ordinary_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Six_Personal_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Take_Bath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Listen_to_Wisdom"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Nerida 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/nerida.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Nerida 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/nerida.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Nerida 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Nerida在三个时代提供恢复沐浴与智慧交流。个人事件会在现代水疗馆、中世纪温泉及未来虚拟水疗馆之间交替推进，务必留意每一步的地点。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Locations_and_Shared_Daily_Services"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>现代可从市中心进入水疗馆；中世纪从国王领地进入温泉；未来则从核心区进入虚拟水疗馆。这三个名称对应实际地图入口，她的普通头像均全天可见。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">温泉</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">全天</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">水疗馆</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">全天</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">虚拟水疗馆</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">全天</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Route_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Unasked_Question"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先完成水疗馆初见，再于已知（25）时在现代09:00—18:00推进静水。相识（50）后，19:00—23:00开放静水谈心。随后到中世纪温泉，在朋友（100）推进同一脉水流，亲密朋友（200）推进第三个答案。</p><p>第三个答案与第一段谈心完成后，继续未问出口的问题。达到迷恋（400），到未来虚拟水疗馆推进容纳河流的房间，再于19:00—23:00返回现代水疗馆完成没有唯一的岸。之后在现代水疗馆同样于19:00—23:00开放一息。这些个人里程碑不影响普通恢复沐浴的使用。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">静水</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">水疗馆; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Nerida 已知（25）；完成：水疗馆</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Nerida +20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">同一脉水流</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">温泉; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Nerida 朋友（100）；完成：静水、静水</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第三个答案</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">温泉; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Nerida 亲密朋友（200）；完成：同一脉水流</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">容纳河流的房间</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">虚拟水疗馆; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Nerida 迷恋（400）；完成：第三个答案、未问出口的问题</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有唯一的岸</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">水疗馆; 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">Nerida 迷恋（400）；完成：容纳河流的房间</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Nerida +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">水疗馆</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">水疗馆; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件"></td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Nerida +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">草药师的学徒</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">杂货店; 10:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">Willow 已遇见（10）；Nerida 已遇见（10）；Hailey 已遇见（10）；未在度假：Willow</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">温柔的老师</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">工艺品与珠宝摊; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">Rose &amp; Arthur 已遇见（10）；Nerida 已遇见（10）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">未问出口的问题</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">温泉; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：第三个答案、静水</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静水</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">水疗馆; 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：静水</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一息</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">水疗馆; 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：没有唯一的岸、未问出口的问题</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">观星约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">水疗馆; 17:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富50；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Private_Bath_with_Nerida_.E2.80.94_Expanded_Branching_Visit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Private_Bath_with_Nerida_—_Expanded_Branching_Visit"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>聆听智慧消耗20分钟，获得1点基础关系，每日安全额度8次。泡澡消耗45分钟、100财富，恢复生命50、精力50、镇定50、饱腹感20，并给予3点基础关系，每日最多10次成功沐浴。两种额度均由三个时代共用。</p><p>观星约会从现代水疗馆发起，要求朋友（100），17:00—19:00开始，消耗120分钟、50财富、40精力，需要相应内容访问权限，只能完成一次。私人沐浴是现代水疗馆另一项活动，要求浪漫感（800），19:00—22:00开始，消耗60分钟、20精力。中世纪温泉动画则要求2,000点关系，在20:00—24:00开始。</p><p>持有以太之石并达到恋爱中（3000）后，亲密羁绊可花60分钟增加一级灵魂石，三个时代共用每日一次额度。持有、激活和培养羁绊是不同步骤，效果详见灵魂石指南。</p><p>可选孕期照料在中世纪温泉进行，准备与拜访条件请参考怀孕系统及当前目标。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，所列关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量会受共通关系修正影响。同一动作的每日额度跟随角色计算，换地点不会获得新额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">力量 60、智力 60、魅力 60、耐力 60、能力 60、创造力 60、感知 60、神秘 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">内心平静</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与孕期 Nerida 亲密相处</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">水疗馆; 19:00–23:00（地点动作）</td><td data-label="条件">处于此动作支持的孕期阶段</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">聆听智慧</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">温泉; 全天<br/>水疗馆; 全天<br/>虚拟水疗馆; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；8次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">泡澡</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">温泉; 全天<br/>水疗馆; 全天<br/>虚拟水疗馆; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；财富100</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+3；10次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Nerida亲密相处</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">温泉; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数2000；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−30 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+50；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Nerida私人沐浴</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">水疗馆; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+25；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密羁绊</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">温泉; 全天<br/>水疗馆; 全天<br/>虚拟水疗馆; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000）；持有以太之石</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">以太之石等级+1；各地点共用每日一次额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">静水</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">64</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未问出口的问题</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">76</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一息</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">97</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>换时代不会重置智慧、沐浴或羁绊额度。个人事件没有出现时，常见原因是关系符合却走错时代。现代私人沐浴、中世纪动画及孕期活动是不同动作，条件也各不相同。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a> · <a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">灵魂石</a> · <a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">怀孕系统</a> · <a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie 的爱之训练</a></p></section>
